  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Enterprise Competitiveness &amp; Access to Markets Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the programme is to contribute to increased private sector participation in regional and global value chains through support to private sector, particularly SMEs, to enhance their competitiveness at various stages of value chains, facilitating business linkages and market access and the enhancement of business and investment environment through implementation of the related regulatory frameworks and policies</narrative>
  </description>
